itual of a musical geniusOxygen cylinder blast in ambulance kills patient outside Odisha hospitalAction, consequence, inheritance, and obligationMargaret Hamilton, scientist who worked on Nasa's Apollo programme, dies'Fauzi' release date: Prabhas’ period actioner eyes March 18, 2027; 'Spirit' may face a schedule change - REPORTSAir India group and Akasa hike fuel surcharge'Ready to do everything in our power': Putin offers to help end Iran warIs Kyrie Irving playing today’s game? Latest status on Dallas Mavericks guard before preseason game against RocketsApocalypse postponed'Crazy Rich Asians' RETURNS as television series; Constance Wu, Henry Golding, Michelle Yeoh to reprise roles - WATCHAs HDFC Bank CEO, Bagchi set for 36 crore target payRock legend Rick Wakeman played piano for 150 rescued moon bears in Vietnam; he now wants the last 125 bears still caged on bile farms moved to sanctuaries“Take the family down there and make a donation”: How Travis Kelce’s mother Donna Kelce and Tammy Reid helped bring Christmas cheer to families in needCopyright © 2026 Bennett, Coleman & Co. Ltd. All rights reserved. For reprint rights: Times Syndication ServiceFollow Us On","title":"Numerology Lucky Number & Colour, 9th October: Number 2 Day Meets Libra Moon-Partnerships, Patience, and Emotional Balance Could Decide the Day","url":"https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/astrology/numerology-tarot/numerology-lucky-number-colour-9th-october-number-2-day-meets-libra-moon-partnerships-patience-and-emotional-balance-could-decide-the-day/articleshow/134787590.cms","id":441},{"content_hash":"cafd7bbbcebb87539715163d49b6a2972c62cd9f6232f03666d6a13e712741f8","domain":"reallygoodemails.com","fetched_at":"2026-10-09T05:28:27.414115+00:00","final_url":"https://reallygoodemails.com/template/healthy-meal-prep-webinar-reminder","language":"","text":"Healthy Meal Prep Webinar Reminder | Email template - RGE StudioNow you have zero excuses to NOT design really good emails. Introducing RGE StudioR